<!--
  Strings shared by every Taffy-owned surface. A module owns the strings it
  uses: checkStringResources fails the build on a reference to a name this
  module does not declare, and on a name this module declares and never uses.

  The seven task-state words are here rather than in a feature because more than
  one feature shows them, and two copies of "Partly done" is how a product ends
  up rounding partial work up to success in one place and not the other.
-->
